  "cves": [
    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-19979",
      "publishedDate": "2026-08-17T03:30:09.125Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-08-17T03:30:09.125Z",
      "description": "A vulnerability was identified in GL.iNet A1300, AX1800, AXT1800, BE1400, BE3600, BE6500, BE9300, BE10000, E5800, MT2500, MT3000, MT3600BE, MT5000, MT6000, X2000, X3000 and XE3000 up to 4.8.x. Affected by this vulnerability is the function COPY/MOVE of the component WebDAV Service. Such manipulation leads to authorization bypass. It is possible to launch the attack remotely. The vendor explains: \"After our investigation, we have confirmed that the vulnerability described (...) does indeed exist.\"",
      "severity": 8.3,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：GL.iNet A1300\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
